Shall the ordinance providing funding for and maintaining supervised
children's play, youth, teen and adult programs, childcare, afterschool and
senior programs in a disabled accessible, fire and earthquake resistant
community center, usable as an emergency health and disaster relief facility,
levying 33¢ per square foot of residential improvements and 54¢ per square
foot of nonresidential improvements, providing $7,100,000 annually until
ended by voters, with senior exemptions and independent audits, increasing
the appropriation limit, be adopted?